+  # computed once instead of re-hashing the same password for every one of
+  # the thousands of users fabricated per suite run (~1 ms each). The
+  # digest verifies against '123456789' exactly as a freshly hashed one
+  # would, so `valid_password?('123456789')` and sign-in with
